Shows the list in the specified format (bolddisk,color,bgcolor)
.TP
\fB\-\-lazy\fR
Perform a lazy mount
.TP
\fB\-n\fR, \fB\-\-no\-headers\fR
Hide headers and formatting frames
.TP
