Timeout for refreshing list in dashboard
.HP
\fB\-\-refresh\-deps\fR =[smb, luks, vera, qemu, sshfs, google\-drive\-ocamlfuse, all, <<apt package>>] Refreshes installation of dependency packages
.TP
